              "worked": "Convert to minutes:\n$$\\begin{align*}t_{\\text{min}}&=\\frac{d+60}{240}\\times60=\\frac{d+60}{4}\\text{ min}\\\\t_{\\text{min}}&=\\frac{20+60}{4}\\\\t_{\\text{min}}&=20\\text{ min}\\end{align*}$$",
              "solutionDiagrams": []
